sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as USER / ADMIN
    participant Folio
    participant API as PaperUploadController
    participant Upload as UploadService
    participant Redis as Redis bitmap
    participant MinIO
    participant MySQL
    participant Kafka
    participant Consumer as PaperProcessingConsumer
    participant MinerU as ParseService / MinerU
    participant Reading as Reading Model / Visual Assets
    participant Index as RetrievalIndexingService
    participant Qdrant

    loop missing chunks
        Folio->>API: POST /papers/upload/chunk
        API->>Upload: uploadChunk
        Upload->>Redis: check bitmap fast path
        alt Redis miss but ChunkInfo exists
            Upload->>Redis: backfill bitmap + idempotent success
        else new chunk
        Upload->>MinIO: store chunk
        Upload->>MySQL: save ChunkInfo
            Upload->>Redis: mark bitmap after durable metadata
        end
    end
    Folio->>API: POST /papers/upload/merge
    API->>Upload: mergeChunks
    Upload->>MySQL: verify all expected ChunkInfo rows
    Upload->>MinIO: verify every chunk object exists
    Upload->>MinIO: compose merged/{paperId}
    Upload->>MinIO: remove temporary chunk objects
    Upload->>MySQL: upload COMPLETED
    Upload->>Redis: delete temporary bitmap
    API->>Kafka: PaperProcessingTask
    Kafka->>Consumer: processTask
    Consumer->>MinIO: read merged PDF
    Consumer->>MinerU: parseAndSave
    MinerU->>MinIO: save parser artifact
    MinerU->>Reading: build pages, sections, elements, locations, passages
    Reading->>MySQL: activate canonical Current Reading Model
    Reading->>MinIO: save page screenshots and evidence crops
    Reading->>MySQL: save visual-asset metadata
    Consumer->>Index: indexWithMetrics
    Index->>Qdrant: sparse + dense vectors
    Index->>MySQL: indexing metrics
    Consumer->>MySQL: processing COMPLETED
    alt parse or indexing failure
        Consumer->>MySQL: mark FAILED
        Consumer--xKafka: retry / dead letter
    end
